sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServeGW as KServe Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant APIServer as vLLM API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Plugin as vllm-gaudi Plugin<br/>(In-process)
    participant HPUWorker as HPU Worker<br/>(In-process)
    participant Gaudi as Intel Gaudi Device<br/>PCIe / HPU API
    participant ModelStore as Model Storage<br/>S3/PVC

    Note over Client,ModelStore: Flow 1: LLM Inference Request

    Client->>KServeGW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KServeGW->>APIServer: Forward (TLS terminated)<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    APIServer->>Plugin: Inference request<br/>Python API (in-process)
    Plugin->>HPUWorker: Schedule on HPU<br/>Bucketed sequence
    HPUWorker->>Gaudi: Execute compiled graph<br/>SynapseAI graph API
    Gaudi-->>HPUWorker: Inference result<br/>Tensors
    HPUWorker-->>Plugin: Output tokens
    Plugin-->>APIServer: Completion response
    APIServer-->>KServeGW: JSON Response<br/>HTTP 200
    KServeGW-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,ModelStore: Flow 2: Model Loading at Startup

    APIServer->>ModelStore: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP or PVC mount
    ModelStore-->>APIServer: Model artifacts<br/>(safetensors / bin)
    APIServer->>Plugin: Load model to HPU
    Plugin->>Gaudi: Transfer weights<br/>H2D transfer
    Gaudi-->>Plugin: Weights loaded

    Note over Client,ModelStore: Flow 3: Distributed Multi-HPU Inference

    participant Ray as Ray Head<br/>6379/TCP
    participant HPU_N as HPU Worker (rank N)
    participant Gaudi_N as Gaudi Device N

    APIServer->>Ray: Distribute inference<br/>Ray protocol
    Ray->>HPUWorker: Assign rank 0
    Ray->>HPU_N: Assign rank N
    HPUWorker->>HPU_N: HCCL All-Reduce<br/>Tensor parallelism
    HPUWorker->>Gaudi: Execute (rank 0)
    HPU_N->>Gaudi_N: Execute (rank N)
    Gaudi-->>HPUWorker: Partial result
    Gaudi_N-->>HPU_N: Partial result
    HPUWorker->>HPU_N: HCCL All-Gather<br/>Combine results
    HPU_N-->>HPUWorker: Combined output
    HPUWorker-->>APIServer: Final result

    Note over Client,ModelStore: Flow 4: KV Cache CPU Offloading

    HPUWorker->>HPUWorker: KV cache full on HPU
    HPUWorker->>HPUWorker: D2H async transfer<br/>Evict cold KV blocks to CPU
    Note right of HPUWorker: CPU memory holds<br/>offloaded KV blocks
    HPUWorker->>HPUWorker: H2D async transfer<br/>Restore KV blocks on cache miss
